<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-25T12:40:45.214Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:40:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gunmen opened fire on a student bus in Mexico, killing multiple passengers, while a separate school bus shooting in Sinaloa injured the driver. Federal authorities arrested an alleged cartel leader linked to a deadly car bombing and detained four Pacific cartel members in Chiapas with weapons and a stolen truck. A former state attorney general faces treason charges over alleged U.S. involvement in a drug raid, and a Texas man was indicted for buying firearms to supply the Sinaloa Cartel. Kidnap survivors described brutal conditions in a cartel prison camp, and a Hells Angels boss was arrested in Cancún, marking a second biker bust in 2026. The conflict’s historical toll includes 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNVEVFQmJseGNjZnVKUGtmRzlmdGRqdHA1Z1Bab1lyVzhEMF94WjN3dzgwR09TSUZ2SENNcmpDVlUyX3FPUkZCM0x2dlI5Q29oQnA5Y3RjU0R6ZHdkYVF1MmxHN01CWklzRHFFS2xqaVZNcEtHN25wRnR2UU5vb2h0cVdZdUNqSVVL?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOYkhmekN3NmhBaXh5bEJtcjdYRXYtcUxwSTBjYkZHblRvWk56TUM4SXlvTzhURG5NLXF5cDAyUlM5WE9XTElsOFJRM0toZ3Y5cUZQdVFRdFY5YklUUGRKaTgwZzJhSTItZmdyeGMwRXdRQ0VQSHN1OUFBZ0t4QzhxVV9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;Unisba Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQaXI0ZGQ0Z1ByekNKRmdGRDROeUdmSlR5ZGx6TXVJMWd6VW5LUnZDNUhlRUJCTXBYTHpnT3RuZTVhUlkxTnJjaHZ0N3NOcktJRS1qTjAtaGt3LU56R3laZko0Q0Jwa0Yxa0lkTW9pendWWmZ4ZFFsQkpJVGkzUlpqQklwNXhJaWNTRm9uTE0tU0hDS09rTkNsUjRqSzhmLTZQQ0JmenR3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNS184aGRfRUFFT0RxSzZLUHEzX2hsbnBKV3hmbEZvY1RvTjZqSkJRd3J0bWJmeVVUVmNWV0dZekNSOWtyNE1XZXhRSmtvaTVOV3k0SjZ5OXFwVldhQTY1M1dPX3V4bnRvWTEzT3hMQjRPMTBuX